#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: appinio-search.php
msgid ""
"Appinio Search – AI Semantic & Multilingual Product Search for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: appinio-search.php
msgid "https://app-in.io/woocommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: appinio-search.php
msgid ""
"Sync WooCommerce products with Appinio AI Search. Real-time hooks + bulk "
"sync."
msgstr ""
"Sünkrooni WooCommerce'i tooted Appinio AI otsinguga. Reaalajas konksud + "
"hulgisünkroonimine."

#. Author of the plugin
#: appinio-search.php
msgid "appinio"
msgstr ""

#: appinio-search.php:42
msgid "Appinio Search requires WooCommerce to be installed and active."
msgstr ""
"Appinio Search nõuab, et WooCommerce oleks paigaldatud ja aktiveeritud."

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:76
msgid "AI Search Button"
msgstr "AI-otsingu nupp"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:79
msgid ""
"A button that opens the AI search. Add it with the \"AI search button\" "
"block or the [appinio_search_button] shortcode. These settings apply to "
"every button."
msgstr ""
"Nupp, mis avab AI-otsingu. Lisa see ploki „AI-otsingu nupp“ või lühikoodiga "
"[appinio_search_button]. Need seaded kehtivad igale nupule."

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:84
msgid "Button Label"
msgstr "Nupu tekst"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:85
msgid "Button Colour"
msgstr "Nupu värv"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:86
msgid "Button Text Colour"
msgstr "Nupu teksti värv"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:87
msgid "Button Icon"
msgstr "Nupu ikoon"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:131
msgid "Button icon"
msgstr "Nupu ikoon"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:132
msgid "Use this icon"
msgstr "Kasuta seda ikooni"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:142 blocks/search-button/index.js:59
msgid "AI search"
msgstr "AI-otsing"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:146
msgid ""
"Text on the button. Leave empty to show \"AI search\" in the visitor's "
"language. With Polylang or WPML, translate your text under their string "
"translations."
msgstr ""
"Nupu tekst. Jäta tühjaks, et näidata „AI-otsing“ külastaja keeles. Polylangi "
"või WPML-iga tõlgi oma tekst nende stringitõlgete all."

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:155
msgid "Button background. Leave empty for the default blue."
msgstr "Nupu taust. Jäta tühjaks, et kasutada vaikimisi sinist."

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:164
msgid "Text and icon colour on the button. Leave empty for white."
msgstr "Teksti ja ikooni värv nupul. Jäta tühjaks, et kasutada valget."

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:182
msgid "Choose icon"
msgstr "Vali ikoon"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:186
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Eemalda"

#: src/Admin/ButtonSettings.php:190
msgid ""
"Replaces the sparkle icon. Use a small square image; it is shown at 16 × 16 "
"pixels."
msgstr ""
"Asendab sädeleva ikooni. Kasuta väikest ruudukujulist pilti; seda näidatakse "
"suuruses 16 × 16 pikslit."

